@SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Check-in
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId" :1
}

### Check-out
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1
}
